---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL, PRIVACY_PATH, SITE_BRAND } from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Cookie Policy"
	description="Cookies and local storage used by iStockVisual for sign-in, security, and theme preference."
	heading="Cookie Policy"
	lede="We use essential cookies to keep you signed in. Theme preference stays in your browser. Browser tools do not set tracking cookies."
>
	<h2>1. What this page covers</h2>
	<p>
		{SITE_BRAND} uses cookies and similar storage so the site can function. This page explains what
		we set and why. How we handle personal data more broadly is in the
		<a href={PRIVACY_PATH}>Privacy Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>2. Essential cookies</h2>
	<p>
		When you create an account or sign in, our authentication system (Better Auth) sets session
		cookies. These cookies are necessary to recognize you, protect the account, and apply free vs
		Pro download access. Without them, signed-in features cannot work.
	</p>
	<p>
		We do not currently set advertising, social-media, or cross-site tracking cookies, and we do not
		use cookies to sell a profile of you to third parties.
	</p>

	<h2>3. Local and session storage</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Theme.</strong> Light or dark appearance is stored in local storage as
			<code>istockvisual-theme</code>. It never leaves your browser.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Visual search.</strong> The current query-photo reference may be kept in session
			storage on your device so the search page can finish loading. The photo itself, if uploaded,
			is stored on our side for about one hour and then deleted, as described in the Privacy Policy.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>4. Browser tools</h2>
	<p>
		Image editor, convert, vectorize, social resize, watermark, and palette tools process files in
		your browser. They do not upload those files and they do not set extra analytics cookies for
		that processing.
	</p>

	<h2>5. How long they last</h2>
	<p>
		Session cookies last while you are signed in or until they expire or you sign out. Local-storage
		theme preference remains until you clear site data or change the theme. You can delete cookies
		and site storage in your browser settings; if you remove session cookies you will need to sign
		in again.
	</p>

	<h2>6. Your choices</h2>
	<p>
		Essential cookies are required for accounts. You can use the public library without an account
		and still download free 512 and 1K sizes. Blocking all cookies may break sign-in, downloads that
		depend on your plan, and some forms.
	</p>
	<p>
		Questions: <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
